   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the judiciary law, in relation to hope cards and to amend a\nchapter of the laws of 2023 amending the judiciary law relating to enacting\nthe \"hope card act\", as proposed in legislative bills numbers S. 5935 and A.\n5040, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S8063",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8063-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §858, Judy L; amd §3, Chap of 2023 (as proposed in S.5935 & A.5040)",
    "lawSection": "Judiciary Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8063\n\nSPONSOR: CLEARE\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the judiciary law, in relation to hope cards and to\namend a chapter of the laws of 2023 amending the judiciary law relating\nto enacting the \"hope card act\", as proposed in legislative bills\nnumbers S. 5935 and A. 5040, in relation to the effectiveness thereof\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis is a chapter amendment to L.2023, ch. 538. It clarifies provisions\nconcerning the form and effect of a hope card, and it modifies the\neffective date of the original chapter.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 modifies multiple provisions of the underlying chapter. Most\nnotably, it clarifies that a court may issue a hope card as either a\nphysical, wallet-sized card or as a digital image, delivered via text\nmessage or other electronic communication, of the final order of\nprotection. The underlying chapter authorized a physical card but not a\ndigital one.\n\nSection 2 extends the effective date of the original chapter, from 180\ndays after enactment to one year after enactment.\n\nSection 3 is the effective date.\n\n \nEXISTING LAW:\n\nNone.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis legislation is a negotiated change to the underlying chapter.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nChapter amendment to Chapter 538 of the Laws of 2023. S.5935 and A.5040\npassed the Senate and Assembly, respectively, in June 2023.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTo be determined.\n\n \nLOCAL FISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTo be determined.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately; provided, however, that section\none of this act shall take effect on the same date and in the same\nmanner as a chapter of the laws of 2023 amending the judiciary law\nrelating to enacting the \"hope card act\", as proposed in legislative\nbills numbers S. 5935 and A. 5040, takes effect.\n",
